    <p style="margin:10px 0 0; color:var(--muted); font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.6;">Two Engine Audit ($29 one-off) covers Google AI Overviews + ChatGPT — the two engines most buyers actually use. Full Audit ($79 one-off) adds Claude, Perplexity and Gemini for complete coverage. Both tiers include the full hallucination + accuracy scoring and a Claude-generated prioritised action plan.</p>
