    <p style="margin:10px 0 0; color:var(--muted); font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.6;">Yes. No card, no signup. The preview runs 8 buyer questions on Google AI Overviews and shows visibility + citation rate. Paid tiers expand the engine set, query count, scoring depth and add the prioritised action plan.</p>
